<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>New Super Store – GK3, New Delhi</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ===== NAVBAR ===== -->
  <nav id="navbar">
    <div class="nav-logo">New Super <span>Store</span></div>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#about">Our Story</a></li>
      <li><a href="#products">Products</a></li>
      <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Contact Us</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="hamburger" id="hamburger" onclick="toggleMenu()">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="hero-pattern"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">

      <div class="hero-left">
        <div class="hero-badge">Serving GK3 Since 1980s</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Your <em>Neighbourhood</em> Superstore, Always</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Four decades of trust, thousands of products, and the kind of service only a true neighbourhood store can offer. From daily essentials to specialty items — we've got it all under one roof.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#products" class="btn-primary">Explore Products ↓</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn-secondary">📞 Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat"><h3>40+</h3><p>Years of Trust</p></div>
          <div class="stat"><h3>2000+</h3><p>Products</p></div>
          <div class="stat"><h3>GK3</h3><p>New Delhi</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="store-card">
          <div class="store-icon-grid">
            <div class="store-icon-item"><span class="icon">🛒</span><span class="label">Groceries</span></div>
            <div class="store-icon-item"><span class="icon">🥤</span><span class="label">Beverages</span></div>
            <div class="store-icon-item"><span class="icon">🧼</span><span class="label">Personal Care</span></div>
            <div class="store-icon-item"><span class="icon">🍿</span><span class="label">Snacks</span></div>
            <div class="store-icon-item"><span class="icon">🧹</span><span class="label">Household</span></div>
            <div class="store-icon-item"><span class="icon">🥛</span><span class="label">Dairy</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="store-card-bottom">
            <div class="open-badge">Open Today</div>
            <div class="store-hours-text">8:00 AM – 10:00 PM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="store-card-info">
            📍 GK3 Market, Greater Kailash III, New Delhi – 110048<br/>
            💳 Cash · Paytm · UPI · Cards accepted
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== ABOUT ===== -->
  <section class="section about" id="about">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="about-grid">

        <div class="about-image-stack reveal">
          <div class="about-img-main">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604719312566-8912e9227c6a?w=600&q=80" alt="Store interior" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-img-accent">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534723328310-e82dad3ee43f?w=400&q=80" alt="Grocery shelves" />
          </div>
          <div class="year-badge">
            <strong>1980</strong>
            <span>Est.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-text reveal">
          <div class="section-tag">Our Story</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">A Cornerstone of the GK3 Community</h2>
          <p class="about-para">New Super Store was born in the early 1980s with a simple idea — give the people of Greater Kailash III a place where they could find everything they need, without travelling far, and always with a smile.</p>
          <p class="about-para">What started as a modest provisions shop has grown into one of the most well-stocked departmental stores in the locality. Generations of families have shopped here, and we take that trust seriously.</p>
          <p class="about-para">We carry over 2,000 products — from everyday staples to niche health foods, premium snacks, and international brands — all curated to match the evolving tastes of our community.</p>
          <ul class="values-list">
            <li>Family-run business with four decades of community service</li>
            <li>Freshly stocked shelves — dairy, bread &amp; perishables delivered daily</li>
            <li>Accepts cash, Paytm, UPI, and all major cards</li>
            <li>Dedicated to competitive pricing and genuine quality</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== PRODUCTS ===== -->
  <section class="section products" id="products">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="products-header">
        <div>
          <div class="section-tag">What We Carry</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Over 2,000 Products,<br/>One Neighbourhood Store</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Every shelf is packed thoughtfully, so you never have to go anywhere else.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category-filters">
          <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterProducts('all', this)">All</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterProducts('food', this)">Food</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterProducts('drinks', this)">Drinks</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterProducts('home', this)">Home</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterProducts('care', this)">Personal Care</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="products-grid" id="productsGrid"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== BRANDS ===== -->
  <div class="brands reveal">
    <div class="brands-inner">
      <p class="brands-title">Trusted Brands We Carry</p>
      <div class="brands-row" id="brandsRow"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== SERVICES ===== -->
  <section class="section services" id="services">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag">How We Serve You</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Services That Make Your Life Easier</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">We've been improving how we serve the community for over forty years — and we're not done yet.</p>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-icon">🏍️</span>
          <h4>Home Delivery</h4>
          <p>Don't want to step out? Call or WhatsApp us your list and we'll deliver to your doorstep within the GK3 society. Minimum order applies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-icon">📱</span>
          <h4>UPI &amp; Digital Payments</h4>
          <p>Pay the way you prefer — Paytm, PhonePe, Google Pay, BHIM UPI, or any debit/credit card. We're fully equipped for contactless payments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-icon">📦</span>
          <h4>Bulk &amp; Wholesale Orders</h4>
          <p>Stocking up for events, offices, or RWAs? We accommodate bulk orders with advance notice and can arrange special pricing for societies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-icon">🧊</span>
          <h4>Cold Beverages</h4>
          <p>Our Pepsi and Bisleri coolers keep your drinks ice cold year-round. Chilled water, soft drinks, energy drinks, and packaged juices always available.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-icon">🗓️</span>
          <h4>Daily Fresh Stock</h4>
          <p>Bread, eggs, dairy, and perishables are restocked every morning. You'll always find the freshest products when you walk in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-icon">💬</span>
          <h4>Personalised Assistance</h4>
          <p>Can't find something? Our staff knows every corner of the store and can help you locate products, suggest alternatives, or check availability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CONTACT ===== -->
  <section class="section contact" id="contact">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="contact-heading reveal">
        <div class="section-tag">Find Us</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Come Say Hello</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">We're right in the heart of GK3 — pop in anytime, or drop us a message and we'll get back to you quickly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-grid">

        <div class="contact-info">
          <div class="contact-card reveal">
            <div class="contact-icon">📍</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Address</h4>
              <p>New Super Store, GK3 Market<br/>Greater Kailash III, New Delhi – 110048</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card reveal">
            <div class="contact-icon">📞</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Phone</h4>
              <a href="tel:+911129211545">+91 11 2921 1545</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card reveal">
            <div class="contact-icon">⏰</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Store Hours</h4>
              <p>Mon – Sat &nbsp;&nbsp; 8:00 AM – 10:00 PM<br/>Sunday &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card reveal">
            <div class="contact-icon">💳</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Payment Methods</h4>
              <p>Cash · Paytm · UPI · PhonePe · Google Pay · Debit &amp; Credit Cards</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-form-wrap reveal">
          <h3>Send Us a Message</h3>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Your Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="fname" placeholder="Ravi Sharma" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Phone Number</label>
              <input type="tel" id="fphone" placeholder="+91 98100 XXXXX" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>What's This About?</label>
            <select id="ftype">
              <option>Product Enquiry</option>
              <option>Home Delivery Request</option>
              <option>Bulk / Wholesale Order</option>
              <option>Feedback</option>
              <option>Something Else</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Your Message</label>
            <textarea id="fmsg" placeholder="Tell us what you need or ask us anything..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <button class="submit-btn" onclick="submitForm()">Send Message →</button>
          <div class="success-msg" id="successMsg">✅ Thanks! We'll get back to you shortly.</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== MAP ===== -->
  <div class="map-wrap">
    <div class="map-inner">
